    markdown:
      "## delete\n\n`client.mtlsCertificates.delete(account_id: string, mtls_certificate_id: string): { id?: string; ca?: boolean; certificates?: string; expires_on?: string; issuer?: string; name?: string; serial_number?: string; signature?: string; type?: 'custom' | 'gateway_managed' | 'access_managed'; uploaded_on?: string; }`\n\n**delete** `/accounts/{account_id}/mtls_certificates/{mtls_certificate_id}`\n\nDeletes the mTLS certificate unless the certificate is in use by one or more Cloudflare services.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `account_id: string`\n  Identifier.\n\n- `mtls_certificate_id: string`\n  Identifier.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id?: string; ca?: boolean; certificates?: string; expires_on?: string; issuer?: string; name?: string; serial_number?: string; signature?: string; type?: 'custom' | 'gateway_managed' | 'access_managed'; uploaded_on?: string; }`\n\n  - `id?: string`\n  - `ca?: boolean`\n  - `certificates?: string`\n  - `expires_on?: string`\n  - `issuer?: string`\n  - `name?: string`\n  - `serial_number?: string`\n  - `signature?: string`\n  - `type?: 'custom' | 'gateway_managed' | 'access_managed'`\n  - `uploaded_on?: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Cloudflare from 'cloudflare';\n\nconst client = new Cloudflare();\n\nconst mtlsCertificate = await client.mtlsCertificates.delete('023e105f4ecef8ad9ca31a8372d0c353', { account_id: '023e105f4ecef8ad9ca31a8372d0c353' });\n\nconsole.log(mtlsCertificate);\n```",
