    response:
      '{ id: string; created_at: string; description: string; enabled: boolean; match: string; name: string; precedence: number; subnet_id: string; updated_at: string; }',
    markdown:
      '## create\n\n`client.zeroTrust.devices.ipProfiles.create(account_id: string, match: string, name: string, precedence: number, subnet_id: string, description?: string, enabled?: boolean): { id: string; created_at: string; description: string; enabled: boolean; match: string; name: string; precedence: number; subnet_id: string; updated_at: string; }`\n\n**post** `/accounts/{account_id}/devices/ip-profiles`\n\nCreates a WARP Device IP profile. Currently, only IPv4 Device subnets can be associated.\n\n### Parameters\n\n- `account_id: string`\n\n- `match: string`\n  The wirefilter expression to match registrations. Available values: "identity.name", "identity.email", "identity.groups.id", "identity.groups.name", "identity.groups.email", "identity.saml_attributes".\n\n- `name: string`\n  A user-friendly name for the Device IP profile.\n\n- `precedence: number`\n  The precedence of the Device IP profile. Lower values indicate higher precedence. Device IP profile will be evaluated in ascending order of this field.\n\n- `subnet_id: string`\n  The ID of the Subnet.\n\n- `description?: string`\n  An optional description of the Device IP profile.\n\n- `enabled?: boolean`\n  Whether the Device IP profile will be applied to matching devices.\n\n### Returns\n\n- `{ id: string; created_at: string; description: string; enabled: boolean; match: string; name: string; precedence: number; subnet_id: string; updated_at: string; }`\n\n  - `id: string`\n  - `created_at: string`\n  - `description: string`\n  - `enabled: boolean`\n  - `match: string`\n  - `name: string`\n  - `precedence: number`\n  - `subnet_id: string`\n  - `updated_at: string`\n\n### Example\n\n```typescript\nimport Cloudflare from \'cloudflare\';\n\nconst client = new Cloudflare();\n\nconst ipProfile = await client.zeroTrust.devices.ipProfiles.create({\n  account_id: \'account_id\',\n  match: \'identity.email == "test@cloudflare.com"\',\n  name: \'IPv4 Cloudflare Source IPs\',\n  precedence: 100,\n  subnet_id: \'b70ff985-a4ef-4643-bbbc-4a0ed4fc8415\',\n});\n\nconsole.log(ipProfile);\n```',
